-- Chương I: the general exclusions (Điều 11) and the reductions of compensation (Điều 13).
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/tasco-combined-motor-2024.txt.
-- Chương II, III and IV each apply Điều 11 "ngoài" their own exclusions (src:776, 998, 1037).
-- Chương V lists its own (Điều 33) and does not refer to Điều 11 (fork F19).
-- Điều 13 applies to every cover but the accident cover of Chương III, as its heading says.

§ `Chương I — general provisions: exclusions and reductions`

§§ `Điều 11 — the general exclusions`

