GIVEN `the driving` IS A `The way the vehicle was driven`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`art 11.5 — prohibited road or manoeuvre` `the driving` MEANS
        `the driving`'s `entered a prohibited road or area`
    OR  `the driving`'s `drove against the direction of traffic`
    OR  `the driving`'s `reversed on an expressway`
    OR  `the driving`'s `turned or made a U-turn where prohibited`
    OR  `the driving`'s `stopped or parked where a sign prohibits it`
    OR  `the driving`'s `ran a red light or disobeyed a traffic controller`
    OR  `the driving`'s `drove at night without the required lights`

