`art 11.8 — outside Vietnam` `the circumstances` MEANS
    `the circumstances`'s `outside Vietnam`

@ref Rules, Điều 11.9 (src:655-658)
GIVEN `the circumstances` IS A `The circumstances of the loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`art 11.9 — war, terrorism, riot or explosives` `the circumstances` MEANS
        `the circumstances`'s `war or terrorism`
    OR  `the circumstances`'s `vandalism in a protest, riot or public disorder`
    OR  `the circumstances`'s `bombs, mines or explosive devices`

§§§ `11.10 Overload of 50% or more`

-- The excess over the figure on the inspection certificate, as a share of that figure: by load
-- for a goods vehicle, by people for a passenger vehicle, by either for a vehicle that carries
-- both (the larger excess; fork F17). Children under 7 are not counted. Điều 13.1.4 and 15.7
-- use the same measure.
-- src:660 | 10. Xe chở /kéo /cẩu quá tải, quá số lượng người quy định 50% trở lên (không bao gồm trẻ em
-- src:661 | dưới 07 tuổi) theo quy định trên Giấy chứng nhận kiểm định (Đối với xe chở hàng căn cứ vào
-- src:662 | trọng tải, xe chở người căn cứ vào số người chở trên xe, đối với xe vừa chở người vừa chở
-- src:663 | hàng căn cứ vào trọng tải hoặc số người chở trên xe)
@ref Rules, Điều 11.10 (src:660-663); Điều 13.1.4 (src:723-725); Điều 15.7 (src:800-804)
GIVEN `the load` IS A `The load at the time of the loss`
      `what it carries` IS A `What the vehicle carries`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the overload, as a share of the permitted figure` `the load` `what it carries` MEANS
    CONSIDER `what it carries`
    WHEN `goods only`            THEN `by load`
    WHEN `people only`           THEN `by people`
    WHEN `both goods and people` THEN max `by load` `by people`
    WHERE
        `by load` MEANS
            (`the load`'s `load carried, towed or lifted` MINUS `the load`'s `permitted load`)
                DIVIDED BY `the load`'s `permitted load`
        `by people` MEANS
            (`the load`'s `number of people carried, not counting children under 7` MINUS `the load`'s `permitted number of people`)
                DIVIDED BY `the load`'s `permitted number of people`

@ref Rules, Điều 11.10 (src:660-663)
GIVEN `the load` IS A `The load at the time of the loss`
      `what it carries` IS A `What the vehicle carries`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`art 11.10 — overload of 50% or more` `the load` `what it carries` MEANS
    `the overload, as a share of the permitted figure` `the load` `what it carries` AT LEAST 50%

§§§ `11.11 Speed 50% or more over the limit`

-- As found by the competent authority; with no finding, the exclusion cannot fire.
-- src:665 | TẾ. Xe chạy quá tốc độ từ 50% trở lên so với tốc độ cho phép theo quy định của pháp luật theo kết
-- src:666 | quả xác định từ cơ quan chức năng.
@ref Rules, Điều 11.11 (src:665-666)
GIVEN `the speed` IS A `The speed at the time of the loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the speeding, as a share of the limit` `the speed` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the speed`'s `speed found by the competent authority`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
    WHEN JUST `found` THEN (`found` MINUS `the speed`'s `speed limit`) DIVIDED BY `the speed`'s `speed limit`

@ref Rules, Điều 11.11 (src:665-666)
GIVEN `the speed` IS A `The speed at the time of the loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`art 11.11 — speed 50% or more over the limit` `the speed` MEANS
    `the speeding, as a share of the limit` `the speed` AT LEAST 50%

§§§ `Which general exclusions fire`

-- Every point of Điều 11 that fires, in the order the rules print them. Empty when none does.
@ref Rules, Điều 11 (src:611-666)
GIVEN `the circumstances` IS A `The circumstances of the loss`
      `what it carries` IS A `What the vehicle carries`
      `the loss is to property` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
`art 11 — the general exclusions that apply` `the circumstances` `what it carries` `the loss is to property` MEANS
    `the points that fire among`
        (LIST (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.1 intentional damage`,                    `fires` IS `art 11.1 — intentional damage` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.1 no valid inspection certificate`,       `fires` IS `art 11.1 — no valid inspection certificate in road traffic` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.2 driver's age or licence`,               `fires` IS `art 11.2 — the driver's age or licence` (`the circumstances`'s `driver`))
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.3 special equipment operated without a permit`, `fires` IS `art 11.3 — special equipment operated without a permit` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.4 alcohol or drugs`,                      `fires` IS `art 11.4 — alcohol or drugs` (`the circumstances`'s `driver`) `the loss is to property`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.5 prohibited road or manoeuvre`,          `fires` IS `art 11.5 — prohibited road or manoeuvre` (`the circumstances`'s `way the vehicle was driven`))
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.6 racing, unlawful towing or goods`,      `fires` IS `art 11.6 — racing, unlawful towing or unlawful goods` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.7 explosives or unlawful goods`,          `fires` IS `art 11.7 — explosives or unlawful goods` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.8 outside Vietnam`,                       `fires` IS `art 11.8 — outside Vietnam` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.9 war, terrorism, riot or explosives`,    `fires` IS `art 11.9 — war, terrorism, riot or explosives` `the circumstances`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.10 overload of 50% or more`,              `fires` IS `art 11.10 — overload of 50% or more` (`the circumstances`'s `load`) `what it carries`)
            , (`A candidate exclusion` WITH `point` IS `art 11.11 speed 50% or more over the limit`,     `fires` IS `art 11.11 — speed 50% or more over the limit` (`the circumstances`'s `speed`)))

-- The points of a list of candidates that fire, in order. Used by every chapter.
GIVEN `the candidates` IS A LIST OF `A candidate exclusion`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
`the points that fire among` `the candidates` MEANS
    map (GIVEN c YIELD c's `point`) (filter (GIVEN c YIELD c's `fires`) `the candidates`)

§§ `Điều 13 — reducing the compensation`

-- src:673 | Điều 13: Giảm trừ bồi thường (không áp dụng đối với bảo hiểm tai nạn Lái, phụ xe và người ngồi
-- src:674 | trên xe)
-- The OCR reads the number 1 as "+" and point (c) of 1.1 as "L4"; the page reads "1." and "c.".
-- src:676 | + Bảo hiểm Tasco thực hiện giảm trừ bồi thường theo tỷ lệ trong một số trường hợp sau đây:
